{"3993890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ICHORLESS", "steam_appid": 3993890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>ICHORLESS</i></strong> is an RPG where you play as a modern-day human, mysteriously pulled into ancient Greece to fulfill a prophecy that’s supposed to save the gods! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey home, you’ll face Gods,  Demigods, Monsters, Mortals, and Titans in a mythic world overflowing with danger, drama, and just a bit of absurdity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat, or gain the favor of a god to earn their <strong><i>Blessing!</i></strong>—unique powers that completely change how you battle the next divine challenger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got Apollo’s Blessing? Great! <i>If you want, you can turn every single boss fight into a singing showdown. </i>Prefer puzzles? Survival challenges? Bullet-hell shooting? Classic turn-based strategy? Fighting games?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>You decide how to enjoy this adventure!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape not just your gaming experience… but the fate of Greece itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- An Original, <strong><i><u>Fully-Composed Soundtrack</u></i></strong> to immerse you in the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong><i><u>Innovative Battle Mechanics</u></i></strong> that keep every encounter fresh and strategic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Branching Storylines with <strong><i><u>Over 50 Unique Endings</u></i></strong> shaped entirely by your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Witty Humor and Clever <strong><i><u>Nods to Mythology for fans of legendary tales.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-  <strong><i><u>20+ Reason Battles </u></i></strong>—master all and forge your own path!</p><p class=\"